       "w:zoo,",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b30",
     "shot": "commune",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Then, in March 1871, Parisians rose against the national government and set up their",
     "date": 1871,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s07b31",
     "shot": "commune",
